+- **Misbehaving bots:** an addition. A bot that posts more than 10 messages in 10 seconds (bot API
+  posts and webhook answers alike) gets `429` with `Retry-After` for 30 seconds, and five more
+  attempts in that time suspend it; so do ten failed webhook deliveries in a row. A suspended bot
+  gets `403`, hears no webhooks, and keeps its rooms and messages until an administrator
+  reactivates it on the bots page. Added `bot_suspensions` and `bot_throttles` tables, and an
+  index on `messages` (`creator_id`, `created_at`), which Rails Campfire ignores.
 - **WebSockets:** `permessage-deflate` without context takeover compresses each broadcast once
   for all subscribers. Decoded messages remain identical.
 - **CSRF:** `Sec-Fetch-Site` replaces tokens. Writes accept `same-origin` and `same-site`, reject
